### AEIOU — Epistemic Articulacy of Applied Sciences

+1HP Scientific Terminology Classification Architecture

Classification: Interdisciplinary Science · Applied Research · Scientific Nomenclature · Information Architecture · Institutional Modernization

Epistemic Articulacy organizes scientific terminology according to the relationship between observable phenomena, established scientific knowledge, analytical methods, applied technologies, and verifiable outcomes.

The following register translates your AEIOU architecture into a functional catalogue of applied sciences.

